          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balwa m'owok bongi Paulo, jatic pa Were kendo jamoor pa Yesu Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyeran aka ooran konyo yeyo pa ji pa Were m'oyer, gi telo jo jowoŋey adieri ma kelo lworo Were, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "m'ocungo kwoŋ geno kwo makirum. Were ma kitwodi, ociko wan kwo me con mafodi hongo k'ocakere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka munyo ndir mere otundo, go onyutho wac me. Okethi wac no i cingan, aka atito paka Were ma jaboth mawan ooran.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
